## Relationships

### Semantic

- [CXC-TIER-SYMMETRY] EXEMPLIFIES [CXC-VISION-COMPACT-WIRE]
- [CXC-TIER-SYMMETRY] MIRRORS [CXC-VISION-COMPACT-WIRE]
- [CXC-TIER-TIERS] EXTENDS [LEC-QUERY]
- [CXC-TIER-INSUFFICIENT] UPHOLDS [CXC-TIER-TRUNCATION-IS-A-LIE]
